    "confidence": "medium",
    "note": "「死生之地，存亡之道，不可不察也」把不可逆的重大決定上升為審察義務",
    "excerpt": "孫子曰：兵者，國之大事，死生之地，存亡之道，不可不察也。故經之以五事，校之以七計",
    "tagged_by": "claude-opus-4-7",
    "tagged_at": "2026-07-28T00:00:00+08:00"
  },
  {
    "para_id": "sunzi-bingfa#01-p02",
    "anchor": {
      "chapter": "始計第一",
      "para_index": 2
    },
    "psych_domains": [
      "V",
      "VII"
    ],
    "discourse_mode": [
      "proposition",
      "formalization"
    ],
    "confidence": "high",
    "note": "五事七計：「道者，令民與上同意」以認同度為戰力要素；「將者，智信仁勇嚴」是品格清單",
    "excerpt": "道者，令民與上同意，可與之死，可與之生，而不畏危也。天者，陰陽、寒暑、時制也。地",
    "tagged_by": "claude-opus-4-7",
    "tagged_at": "2026-07-28T00:00:00+08:00"
  },
  {
    "para_id": "sunzi-bingfa#01-p03",
    "anchor": {
      "chapter": "始計第一",
      "para_index": 3
    },
    "psych_domains": [
      "VII"
    ],
    "discourse_mode": [
      "proposition",
      "prescription"
    ],
    "confidence": "medium",
    "note": "「兵者，詭道也」＋詭道十二法：對誠實規範的領域性豁免主張",
    "excerpt": "將聽吾計，用之必勝，留之；將不聽吾計，用之必敗，去之。計利以聽，乃為之勢，以佐其",
    "tagged_by": "claude-opus-4-7",
    "tagged_at": "2026-07-28T00:00:00+08:00"
  },
  {
    "para_id": "sunzi-bingfa#01-p04",
    "anchor": {
      "chapter": "始計第一",
      "para_index": 4
    },
    "psych_domains": [],
    "discourse_mode": [
      "proposition"
    ],
    "confidence": "high",
    "note": null,
    "excerpt": "夫未戰而廟算勝者，得算多也；未戰而廟算不勝者，得算少也。多算勝，少算不勝，而況於",
    "tagged_by": "claude-opus-4-7",
    "tagged_at": "2026-07-28T00:00:00+08:00"
  },
  {
    "para_id": "sunzi-bingfa#02-p01",
    "anchor": {
      "chapter": "作戰第二",
      "para_index": 1
    },
    "psych_domains": [
      "VIII"
    ],
    "discourse_mode": [
      "proposition",
      "prescription"
    ],
    "confidence": "medium",
    "note": "「不盡知用兵之害者，則不能盡知用兵之利」：只算收益不算代價等於沒算",
    "excerpt": "孫子曰：凡用兵之法，馳車千駟，革車千乘，帶甲十萬，千里饋糧，則內外之費，賓客之用",
    "tagged_by": "claude-opus-4-7",
    "tagged_at": "2026-07-28T00:00:00+08:00"
  },
  {
    "para_id": "sunzi-bingfa#02-p02",
    "anchor": {
      "chapter": "作戰第二",
      "para_index": 2
    },
    "psych_domains": [],
    "discourse_mode": [
      "prescription"
    ],
    "confidence": "high",
    "note": null,
    "excerpt": "善用兵者，役不再籍，糧不三載；取用於國，因糧於敵，故軍食可足也。",
    "tagged_by": "claude-opus-4-7",
    "tagged_at": "2026-07-28T00:00:00+08:00"
  },
  {
    "para_id": "sunzi-bingfa#02-p03",
    "anchor": {
      "chapter": "作戰第二",
      "para_index": 3
    },
    "psych_domains": [
      "V"
    ],
    "discourse_mode": [
      "observation",
      "proposition"
    ],
    "confidence": "high",
    "note": "戰爭成本如何落到平民身上：遠輸則百姓貧、百姓之費十去其七",
    "excerpt": "國之貧於師者遠輸，遠輸則百姓貧；近師者貴賣，貴賣則百姓財竭，財竭則急於丘役。力屈",
    "tagged_by": "claude-opus-4-7",
    "tagged_at": "2026-07-28T00:00:00+08:00"
  },
  {
    "para_id": "sunzi-bingfa#02-p04",
    "anchor": {
      "chapter": "作戰第二",
      "para_index": 4
    },
    "psych_domains": [],
    "discourse_mode": [
      "formalization"
    ],
    "confidence": "medium",
    "note": null,
    "excerpt": "故智將務食於敵，食敵一鍾，當吾二十鍾；萁稈一石，當吾二十石。",
    "tagged_by": "claude-opus-4-7",
    "tagged_at": "2026-07-28T00:00:00+08:00"
  },
  {
    "para_id": "sunzi-bingfa#02-p05",
    "anchor": {
      "chapter": "作戰第二",
      "para_index": 5
    },
    "psych_domains": [
      "VI",
      "VIII"
    ],
    "discourse_mode": [
      "proposition",
      "prescription"
    ],
    "confidence": "high",
    "note": "「殺敵者，怒也；取敵之利者，貨也」：憤怒與財貨並列為兩種動機來源",
    "excerpt": "故殺敵者，怒也；取敵之利者，貨也。故車戰，得車十乘以上，賞其先得者，而更其旌旗。",
    "tagged_by": "claude-opus-4-7",
    "tagged_at": "2026-07-28T00:00:00+08:00"
  },
  {
    "para_id": "sunzi-bingfa#02-p06",
    "anchor": {
      "chapter": "作戰第二",
      "para_index": 6
    },
    "psych_domains": [
      "V"
    ],
    "discourse_mode": [
      "proposition"
    ],
    "confidence": "high",
    "note": "「知兵之將，民之司命，國家安危之主也」：把民命的責任歸於指揮者",
    "excerpt": "故兵貴勝，不貴久。故知兵之將，民之司命，國家安危之主也。",
    "tagged_by": "claude-opus-4-7",
    "tagged_at": "2026-07-28T00:00:00+08:00"
  },
  {
    "para_id": "sunzi-bingfa#03-p01",
    "anchor": {
      "chapter": "謀攻第三",
      "para_index": 1
    },
    "psych_domains": [
      "VII"
    ],
    "discourse_mode": [
      "proposition"
    ],
    "confidence": "medium",
    "note": "全勝優於破勝、「不戰而屈人之兵」：以不毀壞為最高標準的暴力節制立場",
    "excerpt": "孫子曰：凡用兵之法，全國為上，破國次之；全軍為上，破軍次之；全旅為上，破旅次之；",
    "tagged_by": "claude-opus-4-7",
    "tagged_at": "2026-07-28T00:00:00+08:00"
  },
  {
    "para_id": "sunzi-bingfa#03-p02",
    "anchor": {
      "chapter": "謀攻第三",
      "para_index": 2
    },
    "psych_domains": [
      "VI"
    ],
    "discourse_mode": [
      "proposition",
      "prescription"
    ],
    "confidence": "high",
    "note": "「將不勝其忿，而蟻附之」：把指揮官的情緒失控直接列為戰術災難的原因",
    "excerpt": "故上兵伐謀，其次伐交，其次伐兵，其下攻城。攻城之法，為不得已。修櫓轒轀，具器械，",
    "tagged_by": "claude-opus-4-7",
    "tagged_at": "2026-07-28T00:00:00+08:00"
  },
  {
    "para_id": "sunzi-bingfa#03-p03",
    "anchor": {
      "chapter": "謀攻第三",
      "para_index": 3
    },
    "psych_domains": [
      "VII"
    ],
    "discourse_mode": [
      "proposition"
    ],
    "confidence": "medium",
    "note": null,
    "excerpt": "故善用兵者，屈人之兵而非戰也，拔人之城而非攻也，毀人之國而非久也，必以全爭於天下",
    "tagged_by": "claude-opus-4-7",
    "tagged_at": "2026-07-28T00:00:00+08:00"
  },
  {
    "para_id": "sunzi-bingfa#03-p04",
    "anchor": {
      "chapter": "謀攻第三",
      "para_index": 4
    },
    "psych_domains": [],
    "discourse_mode": [
      "formalization"
    ],
    "confidence": "high",
    "note": null,
    "excerpt": "故用兵之法，十則圍之，五則攻之，倍則分之，敵則能戰之，少則能守之，不若則能避之。",
    "tagged_by": "claude-opus-4-7",
    "tagged_at": "2026-07-28T00:00:00+08:00"
  },
  {
    "para_id": "sunzi-bingfa#03-p05",
    "anchor": {
      "chapter": "謀攻第三",
      "para_index": 5
    },
    "psych_domains": [
      "V"
    ],
    "discourse_mode": [
      "proposition"
    ],
    "confidence": "medium",
    "note": null,
    "excerpt": "夫將者，國之輔也。輔周則國必強，輔隙則國必弱。",
    "tagged_by": "claude-opus-4-7",
    "tagged_at": "2026-07-28T00:00:00+08:00"
  },
  {
    "para_id": "sunzi-bingfa#03-p06",
    "anchor": {
      "chapter": "謀攻第三",
      "para_index": 6
    },
    "psych_domains": [
      "V"
    ],
    "discourse_mode": [
      "observation",
      "proposition"
    ],
    "confidence": "high",
    "note": "三種君主越權干預的病象（縻軍、軍士惑、軍士疑）：外行指揮內行的機制描述",
    "excerpt": "故君之所以患於軍者三：不知軍之不可以進而謂之進，不知軍之不可以退而謂之退，是為縻",
    "tagged_by": "claude-opus-4-7",
    "tagged_at": "2026-07-28T00:00:00+08:00"
  },
  {
    "para_id": "sunzi-bingfa#03-p07",
    "anchor": {
      "chapter": "謀攻第三",
      "para_index": 7
    },
    "psych_domains": [
      "V"
    ],
    "discourse_mode": [
      "proposition",
      "formalization"
    ],
    "confidence": "high",
    "note": "知勝五條含「上下同欲者勝」「將能而君不御者勝」：凝聚與授權被列為可檢核的勝因",
    "excerpt": "故知勝有五：知可以戰與不可以戰者勝，識衆寡之用者勝，上下同欲者勝，以虞待不虞者勝",
    "tagged_by": "claude-opus-4-7",
    "tagged_at": "2026-07-28T00:00:00+08:00"
  },
  {
    "para_id": "sunzi-bingfa#03-p08",
    "anchor": {
      "chapter": "謀攻第三",
      "para_index": 8
    },
    "psych_domains": [
      "II"
    ],
    "discourse_mode": [
      "proposition"
    ],
    "confidence": "high",
    "note": "「知彼知己」：自我認識與認識他人被列為對稱且同等的能力",
    "excerpt": "故曰：知彼知己，百戰不殆；不知彼而知己，一勝一負；不知彼不知己，每戰必殆。",
    "tagged_by": "claude-opus-4-7",
    "tagged_at": "2026-07-28T00:00:00+08:00"
  },
  {
    "para_id": "sunzi-bingfa#04-p01",
    "anchor": {
      "chapter": "軍形第四",
      "para_index": 1
    },
    "psych_domains": [
      "XI"
    ],
    "discourse_mode": [
      "proposition"
    ],
    "confidence": "high",
    "note": "「不可勝在己，可勝在敵」「勝可知，而不可為」：明確劃出可致力者與不可強求者的分界",
    "excerpt": "孫子曰：昔之善戰者，先為不可勝，以待敵之可勝。不可勝在己，可勝在敵。故善戰者，能",
    "tagged_by": "claude-opus-4-7",
    "tagged_at": "2026-07-28T00:00:00+08:00"
  },
  {
    "para_id": "sunzi-bingfa#04-p02",
    "anchor": {
      "chapter": "軍形第四",
      "para_index": 2
    },
    "psych_domains": [],
    "discourse_mode": [
      "proposition"
    ],
    "confidence": "medium",
    "note": null,
    "excerpt": "不可勝者，守也；可勝者，攻也。守則不足，攻則有餘。善守者，藏於九地之下；善攻者，",
    "tagged_by": "claude-opus-4-7",
    "tagged_at": "2026-07-28T00:00:00+08:00"
  },
  {
    "para_id": "sunzi-bingfa#04-p03",
    "anchor": {
      "chapter": "軍形第四",
      "para_index": 3
    },
    "psych_domains": [
      "II",
      "VIII"
    ],
    "discourse_mode": [
      "proposition"
    ],
    "confidence": "high",
    "note": "「戰勝而天下曰善，非善之善者也」：可見的成就與眾人的稱許被貶為次級標準",
    "excerpt": "見勝不過衆人之所知，非善之善者也；戰勝而天下曰善，非善之善者也。故舉秋毫不為多力",
    "tagged_by": "claude-opus-4-7",
    "tagged_at": "2026-07-28T00:00:00+08:00"
  },
  {
    "para_id": "sunzi-bingfa#04-p04",
    "anchor": {
      "chapter": "軍形第四",
      "para_index": 4
    },
    "psych_domains": [
      "VIII",
      "II"
    ],
    "discourse_mode": [
      "proposition"
    ],
    "confidence": "high",
    "note": "「無智名，無勇功」：最好的工作不產生可見的功績；勝兵先勝而後求戰",
    "excerpt": "古之所謂善戰者，勝於易勝者也。故善戰者之勝也，無智名，無勇功。故其戰勝不忒。不忒",
    "tagged_by": "claude-opus-4-7",
    "tagged_at": "2026-07-28T00:00:00+08:00"
  },
  {
    "para_id": "sunzi-bingfa#04-p05",
    "anchor": {
      "chapter": "軍形第四",
      "para_index": 5
    },
    "psych_domains": [],
    "discourse_mode": [
      "formalization"
    ],
    "confidence": "high",
    "note": null,
    "excerpt": "兵法：一曰度，二曰量，三曰數，四曰稱，五曰勝。地生度，度生量，量生數，數生稱，稱",
    "tagged_by": "claude-opus-4-7",
    "tagged_at": "2026-07-28T00:00:00+08:00"
  },
  {
    "para_id": "sunzi-bingfa#05-p01",
    "anchor": {
      "chapter": "兵勢第五",
      "para_index": 1
    },
    "psych_domains": [],
    "discourse_mode": [
      "proposition",
      "formalization"
    ],
    "confidence": "medium",
    "note": null,
    "excerpt": "孫子曰：凡治衆如治寡，分數是也；鬥衆如鬥寡，形名是也；三軍之衆，可使必受敵而無敗",
    "tagged_by": "claude-opus-4-7",
    "tagged_at": "2026-07-28T00:00:00+08:00"
  },
  {
    "para_id": "sunzi-bingfa#05-p02",
    "anchor": {
      "chapter": "兵勢第五",
      "para_index": 2
    },
    "psych_domains": [],
    "discourse_mode": [
      "proposition"
    ],
    "confidence": "medium",
    "note": null,
    "excerpt": "凡戰者，以正合，以奇勝。故善出奇者，無窮如天地，不竭如江海。終而復始，日月是也。",
    "tagged_by": "claude-opus-4-7",
    "tagged_at": "2026-07-28T00:00:00+08:00"
  },
  {
    "para_id": "sunzi-bingfa#05-p03",
    "anchor": {
      "chapter": "兵勢第五",
      "para_index": 3
    },
    "psych_domains": [],
    "discourse_mode": [
      "proposition"
    ],
    "confidence": "high",
    "note": null,
    "excerpt": "激水之疾，至於漂石者，勢也；鷙鳥之疾，至於毀折者，節也。故善戰者，其勢險，其節短",
    "tagged_by": "claude-opus-4-7",
    "tagged_at": "2026-07-28T00:00:00+08:00"
  },
  {
    "para_id": "sunzi-bingfa#05-p04",
    "anchor": {
      "chapter": "兵勢第五",
      "para_index": 4
    },
    "psych_domains": [
      "VI",
      "XI"
    ],
    "discourse_mode": [
      "proposition"
    ],
    "confidence": "high",
    "note": "「怯生於勇…勇怯，勢也」：勇與怯被判給處境而非個人品格，全書最強的一則心理歸因命題",
    "excerpt": "紛紛紜紜，鬥亂而不可亂也；渾渾沌沌，形圓而不可敗也。亂生於治，怯生於勇，弱生於強",
    "tagged_by": "claude-opus-4-7",
    "tagged_at": "2026-07-28T00:00:00+08:00"
  },
  {
    "para_id": "sunzi-bingfa#05-p05",
    "anchor": {
      "chapter": "兵勢第五",
      "para_index": 5
    },
    "psych_domains": [],
    "discourse_mode": [
      "proposition",
      "prescription"
    ],
    "confidence": "medium",
    "note": null,
    "excerpt": "故善動敵者，形之，敵必從之；予之，敵必取之。以利動之，以卒待之。",
    "tagged_by": "claude-opus-4-7",
    "tagged_at": "2026-07-28T00:00:00+08:00"
  },
  {
    "para_id": "sunzi-bingfa#05-p06",
    "anchor": {
      "chapter": "兵勢第五",
      "para_index": 6
    },
    "psych_domains": [
      "V",
      "XI"
    ],
    "discourse_mode": [
      "proposition",
      "prescription"
    ],
    "confidence": "high",
    "note": "「求之於勢，不責於人，故能擇人而任勢」：把績效歸因從個人移到結構",
    "excerpt": "故善戰者，求之於勢，不責於人，故能擇人而任勢。任勢者，其戰人也，如轉木石。木石之",
    "tagged_by": "claude-opus-4-7",
    "tagged_at": "2026-07-28T00:00:00+08:00"
  },
  {
    "para_id": "sunzi-bingfa#06-p01",
    "anchor": {
      "chapter": "虛實第六",
      "para_index": 1
    },
    "psych_domains": [
      "XI"
    ],
    "discourse_mode": [
      "proposition",
      "prescription"
    ],
    "confidence": "medium",
    "note": "「致人而不致於人」：主動與被動的分界",
    "excerpt": "孫子曰：凡先處戰地而待敵者佚，後處戰地而趨戰者勞。故善戰者，致人而不致於人。",
    "tagged_by": "claude-opus-4-7",
    "tagged_at": "2026-07-28T00:00:00+08:00"
  },
  {
    "para_id": "sunzi-bingfa#06-p02",
    "anchor": {
      "chapter": "虛實第六",
      "para_index": 2
    },
    "psych_domains": [],
    "discourse_mode": [
      "prescription"
    ],
    "confidence": "high",
    "note": null,
    "excerpt": "能使敵自至者，利之也；能使敵不得至者，害之也。故敵佚能勞之，飽能饑之，安能動之。",
    "tagged_by": "claude-opus-4-7",
    "tagged_at": "2026-07-28T00:00:00+08:00"
  },
  {
    "para_id": "sunzi-bingfa#06-p03",
    "anchor": {
      "chapter": "虛實第六",
      "para_index": 3
    },
    "psych_domains": [],
    "discourse_mode": [
      "proposition"
    ],
    "confidence": "medium",
    "note": null,
    "excerpt": "行千里而不勞者，行於無人之地也。攻而必取者，攻其所不守也；守而必固者，守其所不攻",
    "tagged_by": "claude-opus-4-7",
    "tagged_at": "2026-07-28T00:00:00+08:00"
