    "psych_domains": [],
    "discourse_mode": [
      "proposition"
    ],
    "confidence": "medium",
    "note": null,
    "excerpt": "故知戰之地，知戰之日，則可千里而會戰；不知戰之地，不知戰之日，則左不能救右，右不",
    "tagged_by": "claude-opus-4-7",
